      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. I'm a bit worried about the \"functional regressions\" part though. If we move to their stack and it can't handle our specialized logic or state management, we're looking at massive operational downtime.\n\nCan you do a deep dive into what specifically would be lost? I need you to map out the exact points of failure where the Llama-derivative models would fail to replicate our current reasoning capabilities. If this migration causes a collapse in our service quality, the board needs to see the risks documented clearly.",
